description:
Closes wireshark/wireshark#20943

This affects these:
- Server greeting
- Login request
- Request

For all of these trees were used for most of the packet. This caused the packet diagram to be nearly useless for them. This moves items a level up.

With this MR:
![image](/uploads/b814d4f42905a54c021717f7cd09e946/image.png){width=643 height=600}

![image](/uploads/ccd1dd185b36ee7693f44d78509c6d0c/image.png){width=267 height=600}

Without this MR:
![image](/uploads/b1cccae3dbe758695e9b1a6b76c614d0/image.png){width=643 height=600}

![image](/uploads/991da42be34c2975c0abe8e35299865d/image.png){width=380 height=600}

